= Francisco Largo Caballero

Largo Caballero is the leader of the UGT trade union and the figurehead of the socialist left.

- @organize_workers
- @land_reform
- @labor_minister_action
- @building_the_left
- @pce_cooperation
- @root: Return to main

@organize_workers
title: UGT Mass Mobilization
subtitle: Strengthen union organization in factories and workplaces.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; workers_spd +=5; radicalization +=1; middle_psoe -= 2

We launch an aggressive membership drive and organizational campaign through the UGT. Working-class loyalty to the party grows significantly, though middle-class voters grow nervous over rising trade union power.

@land_reform
title: Land Reform
subtitle: Use our control of the Agriculture Ministry to push the agrarian reforms.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] [? if psoe_in_government = 0 : PSOE not in government: ?] [? if agricultural_minister_party != "PSOE" : The PSOE does not control the agricultural ministry. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and psoe_in_government == 1 and education_minister_party == "PSOE"
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; agricultural_policy_timer -= 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: agricultural_policy

@labor_minister_action
title: Labor Policy
subtitle: Use our control of the Labor Ministry to improve the conditions of our workers.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] [? if psoe_in_government = 0 : PSOE not in government: ?] [? if labor_minister_party != "PSOE" : The PSOE does not control the labor ministry. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and psoe_in_government == 1 and education_minister_party == "PSOE"
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; labor_rights_timer -= 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: labor_rights

@building_the_left
title: Building the Left
subtitle: Push the PSOE to the left.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; caballeristas_strength += 10; caballeristas_dissent -= 8; besteiristas_dissent += 5; prietistas_dissent += 3

We have increased the strength of the left faction within the PSOE. This raised concern among the moderate reformists in the party.

@pce_cooperation
title: Cooperation with the PCE
subtitle: Any cooperation between the parties requires compromise from the PCE as well as the PSOE.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; caballeristas_strength += 5; pce_relation += 6*(1-dissent); besteiristas_dissent += 3; communist_coalition += 1 if pce_cooperation_seen <= 1; pce_cooperation_seen += 1

Largo Caballero attempts to reach out to the PCE to work on commmon goals. 
